MODULE: CandidateHeldCaptureWithoutRegistration
TARGET: CandidateHeld
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: rebuild captures the new physical resume floor without first registering a read hold
PERTURBS: BeginRebuild

--- FIND
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![candidate'] = floor']
--- REPLACE
    /\ held' = [held EXCEPT ![candidate'] = -1]
--- END
